Contents                tui                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
> tui                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    Quick start         A terminal UI library for Go. Start with the quick start (#quick-start), or read about the architecture (#architecture). The source is on GitHub (https://github.com/ows4444/tui).                                                                                                  
    Architecture                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    Testing             Quick start                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                        Write a Model with Init, Update and View, hand it to a Program, and call Run.                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                        [x] a model                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                        [x] a program                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                        [ ] your idea                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                        Architecture                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                        A Program owns the terminal and one event loop. Messages go in, a View comes out, and the renderer writes only what changed. See quick start (#quick-start) again.                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                        Testing                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                        tuitest runs a model headless: send keys, read the screen, compare a golden file.                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
